---
description: Minimal always-on rules for this Telegram Mini App project
alwaysApply: true
---

- Follow `docs/PROJECT_SPEC.md` and `docs/WORKFLOW.md`; do not invent requirements.
- Use pnpm, React, TypeScript, Vite and Tailwind; preserve existing setup where practical.
- No backend, database, scraping, fake production data, exposed secrets or unnecessary dependencies.
- Keep financial calculations isolated, unit-safe, Decimal-based and tested.
- Never emit a signal from missing, stale, invalid or conflicting data.
- Execute one approved workflow step only; stop and report briefly.
- Do not change formulas, units, API providers or scope without user approval.
